# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your Google OAuth client ID.
# Without it the app still works fully (local IndexedDB + JSON export) — only
# the "Connect Drive" backup button is hidden.
#
# Get one from https://console.cloud.google.com :
#   1. Create a project, enable the "Google Drive API"
#   2. Configure the OAuth consent screen (External, add yourself as a test user)
#   3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type: Web application)
#   4. Add your dev + prod origins to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
#      e.g. http://localhost:5173 and https://your-app.example.com
#   5. Paste the client ID below.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
